{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間遅れのI love you.が\n発売されました( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売を記念して私がグアムで撮って\nずっと温めていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集撮影の合間の\nオフショット載せます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5枚しか載せられないから\n厳選した5枚です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おもち」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集撮影中の休憩中に\n一緒にミラーレス持って\nお外で風景撮ったりしてたときの写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣く泣く載せられないもう1枚があって\n一生懸命カメラと戦う\nみりあちゃんが可愛いんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメに載せますね( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「自然体」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キメたお顔より自然な笑顔の方が\n女の子の魅力って出るよね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんちゃんと遊ぶいおりのこの笑顔が\n私はすごく好きなんだ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「夕暮れの野球場」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの写真が求められてるのは\n分かっているんだけど、\nどうしてもこの写真が綺麗で\nみんなに見て欲しくて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集の中で、9人で円になって\n寝転がったのはこの野球場です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「美女」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの誰かと思うくらいの美女。\nあみちゃんって\nすごく綺麗なお顔なのよね( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんがいつか\n写真集出すとしたら\nこの写真入れて欲しい！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「キラキラ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈と日奈子のコンビって\nなんかやっぱりいいよねえ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若さとエネルギッシュさを感じる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろの日傘の写り込みだけ\nすごく残念だけど／(^o^)＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上厳選5枚でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループに分かれて撮影したので\n選抜メンバーのオフショットが\n全然なくて申し訳ないです（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集の内容のお話になりますが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全メンバーでの写真集だから\nほぼ載らないんじゃないかと\n思っていましたが、\nわりと載っていて\nどのメンバーのファンの方も\n楽しめると思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の水着カットは少ーしだけ\n載ってました(^o^)(笑)\nお腹たぷたぷだったから一安心(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな\nお遊びカメラマンかりんの写真とは\n全く比べものにならない位\nとっても可愛くて綺麗な写真が\nたくさん載っている写真集に\nなっていますので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひみなさんご覧ください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/05/5888898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}